BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Open Edition//Miami Art Week//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
X-WR-CALNAME:Open Edition (miami art week)
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-0-20261204T2200@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T233000
SUMMARY:Welcome dinner at Mangrove
DESCRIPTION:A relaxed first night. Jamaican food and cocktails downtown at 103 NW 1st Ave. The kitchen is open until 11:45 on Fridays and there’s a DJ later. Around $30 each before drinks.\nReserve: https://www.opentable.ca/r/mangrove-miami
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-1-20261205T1000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
SUMMARY:Breakfast at Libertino Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Wynwood\, 2659 NW 2nd Ave. Good coffee\, milk bread sandwiches and waffles.\nDetails: https://wynwoodmiami.com/businesses/libertino-cafe/\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Libertino%20Cafe%2C%202659%20NW%202nd%20Ave%2C%20Miami%2C%20FL
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-2-20261205T1130@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T124500
SUMMARY:Galleries
DESCRIPTION:We’ll walk through Wynwood and the Design District. ICA Miami is free\, and Superblue is $42 if you want to add it.\nICA Miami: https://icamiami.org\nSuperblue tickets: https://tickets.superblue.com/en/tickets/immersive-art-experience-miami-superblue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-3-20261205T1245@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T124500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T134500
SUMMARY:Lunch at The Taco Stand
DESCRIPTION:Wynwood\, 313 NW 25th St\, a short walk from the galleries. Fish tacos and carne asada fries. Cheap and quick before the fair.\nMenu: https://letstaco.com\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The%20Taco%20Stand%2C%20313%20NW%2025th%20St%2C%20Miami%2C%20FL
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-4-20261205T1345@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T134500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T141500
SUMMARY:Water taxi to the fair
DESCRIPTION:Free. Boats leave the Venetian Marina\, 1635 N Bayshore Dr\, every 7–9 minutes for Maurice Gibb Park in Miami Beach. A free shuttle goes from there to the fair.\nTimes and stops: https://www.miamibeachfl.gov/art-week-miami-beach/artweek-free-transportation/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-5-20261205T1415@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T141500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T183000
SUMMARY:Art Basel Miami Beach
DESCRIPTION:Miami Beach Convention Center\, open until 6. The $92 day ticket is all we need.\nTickets: https://www.artbasel.com/miami-beach
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-6-20261205T1830@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T200000
SUMMARY:Home to get ready
DESCRIPTION:Water taxi back\, or a shared ride.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-7-20261205T2000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T220000
SUMMARY:Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Still deciding between somewhere special and somewhere more affordable. I’ll confirm closer to the date.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-8-20261205T2200@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T233000
SUMMARY:Everyday People
DESCRIPTION:The Art Week party\, Saturday\, December 5 at Wynwood Marketplace. Last year tickets were about $35.\nTickets on DICE: https://dice.fm/partner/tickets/event/q2wkl9-everyday-people-miami-5th-dec-wynwood-marketplace-miami-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-9-20261206T1000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T113000
SUMMARY:VOUS Church
DESCRIPTION:Design District\, 77 NE 40th St. Services at 10 and 12.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=VOUS%20Church%2C%2077%20NE%2040th%20St%2C%20Miami%2C%20FL
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-10-20261206T1130@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T121500
SUMMARY:Matcha at Bigface
DESCRIPTION:40 NE 40th St\, across the street.\nDetails: https://www.miamidesigndistrict.com/listing/1304/bigface/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-11-20261206T1215@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T121500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T134500
SUMMARY:Magic City Flea Market
DESCRIPTION:At Ironside in Little River\, 7580 NE 4th Ct\, a few minutes from the house. Vintage clothes\, handmade pieces and art from local vendors. It usually opens at noon on Sundays. I’ll confirm the hours for that weekend.\nIronside calendar: https://miamiironside.com/allactivities\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Miami%20Ironside%2C%207580%20NE%204th%20Ct%2C%20Miami%2C%20FL
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-12-20261206T1345@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T134500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T150000
SUMMARY:Wynwood Walls
DESCRIPTION:About $12–15\, and an hour is plenty.\nTickets: https://thewynwoodwalls.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-13-20261206T1500@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T163000
SUMMARY:Casa Neos
DESCRIPTION:A day party on the Miami River. About $100–150 each. If you’re flying home Sunday\, pack in the morning and head to the airport from here.\nReserve: https://www.opentable.com/r/casa-neos-miami
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-14-20261207T0900@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T110000
SUMMARY:Coffee\, then pack
DESCRIPTION:Checkout is at 11\, which I’m confirming with the host. We’ll bring our bags with us.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-15-20261207T1100@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T123000
SUMMARY:Work from Miami
DESCRIPTION:A coworking space in Wynwood or a café with good Wi-Fi. We’ll pick one closer to the date.
END:VEVENT
