UID:oe-16-20261207T1100@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T120000
SUMMARY:Or take the day off
DESCRIPTION:A swim\, anything we missed\, or a long lunch.
END:VEVENT
