UID:oe-17-20261207T1200@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T161513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T180000
SUMMARY:Nikki Beach
DESCRIPTION:A few of us are going. We’ll aim for a table\, which has a $50 minimum spend per person. If you want to join\, let me know in the RSVP.\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nikki%20Beach%20Miami%20Beach
END:VEVENT
